            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the case concerns the interpretation of the companionship services exemption under the Fair Labor Standards Act as amended in 1974."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "96b6bcd94461be0ff06162a80095bf1ead63d7d7e50d895ecbd7b198103d713e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-96b6bcd94461-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the Department of Labor\u2019s regulations implementing that exemption may be entitled to Chevron deference when they are a permissible implementation of the statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "96b6bcd94461be0ff06162a80095bf1ead63d7d7e50d895ecbd7b198103d713e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-96b6bcd94461-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 50,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case was submitted to the Court for argument."
      }
    ],
