          "text": "Petitioners argue that because the Department of Labor filled in the details through notice\u2011and\u2011comment rulemaking, its regulations should receive Chevron deference when they are a permissible implementation of the statute."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
